text *Sigh*
text I throw myself down onto the un-made kotatsu.
text @[Tomoya]
text How did it end up like this...?
text I kind of feel like this was a line that belonged to Sunohara up until yesterday.
text ...So now, on one hand, we have Sunohara playing at being lovers with Sanae-san.
text And then we have me, waiting for this apparition called Sunohara's little sister.
text @[Tomoya]
text Ghaaah! What's with this difference in fortune!?!
text @[Tomoya]
text I can't take it anymore...! I'll just go to the arcades or something...
text ...is what I think, but when I do, Sanae-san's words spring back to mind.
text You proposed the plan, so you should be held responsible for what happens.
text They were absurd words, but somehow I just wasn't able to shrug them off.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Guess I'll sleep.
text In the end, I decided to go sulk myself to sleep.
text I take a manga from a stack, put it onto the pillow, and lie down.
text The inside of the kotatsu feels warm. When I close my eyes, sleepiness comes over me naturally.
